      "side": 1,
      "message": "Yes can be used with nfsv3 also. only the data transfer channel will be encrypted.\nfor nfsv4.0 callback channel is not encrypted.\nfor nfsv4.1+ full support.\n\nHave plans to add these missing support in future.\n\nPlease have look at libntirpc changes required for this TLS : https://github.com/nfs-ganesha/ntirpc/pull/369",
