      "message": "I am using CentOS9 and CentOS10 clients.\nMounts with AUTH_TLS for nfsv3 is working and can see in server logs AUTH_TLS requests from client.\n\nCheck is some config missing in ganesha.conf",
      "parentUuid": "1368d1f5_ca471f93",
      "revId": "20349d78d3990674e9f45aa6dd8e54317d7986bd",
